<title>POLAND: Swarzedz Q1 net falls to PLN 62.000.</title>
<headline>Swarzedz Q1 net falls to PLN 62.000.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swarzedz preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 2.71 vs	3.32</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   0.50 vs	0.23</p>
<p>    net profit				 0.06 vs	0.13</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Swarzedzkie Fabryki Mebli Swarzedz SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 29.73 vs     26.40</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  28.35 vs     19.06</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		    na  vs	 na</p>
<p>    income tax				 0.44 vs	0.10</p>
<p>    other taxes				 na  vs	 na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.38 vs	0.11</p>
<p>    financial costs			  2.59 vs	3.20</p>
<p>    investment				 0.21 vs	0.31</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
